  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jurisdictional Transformation in GCF Task Force State and Provinces</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support innovative GCF tropical forest states and provinces to meet the commitments of the Rio Branco Declaration by developing/updating jurisdictional strategies and investment plans for REDD+ and low emissions development and catalysing transformative financing opportunities. The project has one outcome: Innovative jurisdictional approaches to REDD+ are developed and implemented.</narrative>
  </description>
